{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43330","headline":"勅赐三相马 · 张随","name":"勅赐三相马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上苑骅骝出，中宫诏命传。\n九天班锡礼，三相代劳年。\n顾主声犹发，追风力正全。\n鸣珂龙阙下，喷玉凤池前。\n四足疑云灭，双瞳比镜悬。\n爲因能致远，今日表求贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张随","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}